{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_176_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_176","textTraditional":"一、二十有六年，春，王二月，辛卯，衞寧喜弒其君剽。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_176_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_176","textTraditional":"此不正，其日何也？殖也立之，喜也君之，正也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_176_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_176","textTraditional":"二、衞孫林父入於戚以叛。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_176_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_176","textTraditional":"三、甲午，衞侯衎復歸於衞。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_176_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_176","textTraditional":"日歸，見知弒也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_176_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_176","textTraditional":"四、夏，晉侯使荀吳來聘。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_176_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_176","textTraditional":"五、公會晉人、鄭良霄、宋人、曹人於澶淵。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_176_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_176","textTraditional":"六、秋，宋公殺其世子痤。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_176_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_176","textTraditional":"七、晉人執衞寧喜。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_176_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_176","textTraditional":"八、八月，壬午，許男寧卒於楚。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_176_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_176","textTraditional":"九、冬，楚子、蔡侯、陳侯伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_176_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_176","textTraditional":"十、葬許靈公","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}